  "title": "Tang mission 750–754 chapter, preparation",
  "change_explanation": "Publishes the chapter's preparation as one set: 15 places, 12 actors, 29 events, 9 relationships, and 1 story, with the 11 cited sources pinned. The preparation history was flattened on the owner's instruction of 2026-09-24, so each record carries one revision: the earlier preparation revisions and their corrections are folded into it, and a record's change explanation still says where a review correction, an owner-accepted court-act placement, or an owner-accepted identification shaped the content. The set records the preparing editor's self-review; the owner decided that this content may be published (see rfd/0002/PUBLICATION_APPROVAL.adoc), but the owner's editorial approval under RFD 2 is still pending and is not implied by this set.",
